        "original_id": "da82e866-3f71-5c74-a931-13123b26099b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Édouard Roger-Vasselin, Heather Watson, Julien Benneteau, Nicolas Mahut, Paul Hanley, Jamie Murray, Monica Puig\n- Events: Roland Garros 2014, 2012 Open Sud de France – Doubles, 2013 HP Open – Singles\n- Roles: tennis players, defending champion, Wimbledon Mixed Doubles Champion\n- Places: France, Britain\n\nFacts:\n- Édouard Roger-Vasselin was born on 28 November 1983 and is a French male tennis player.\n- Heather Miriam Watson was born on 19 May 1992 and is a British tennis player and a Wimbledon Mixed Doubles Champion.\n- In 2012, Nicolas Mahut and Édouard Roger-Vasselin won the 2012 Open Sud de France doubles final by defeating third seeds Paul Hanley and Jamie Murray 6–4, 7–6.\n- In 2013, defending champion Heather Watson lost in the first round of the 2013 HP Open singles event to Monica Puig.\n- In 2014, Édouard Roger-Vasselin and Julien Benneteau won the men's doubles title at Roland Garros.",
